(7450634, 1179361, 163081, '<td valign="top">I really like the image, not so much the title. Very good use of the Dutch tilt technique to intensify the feeling. Voted earlier and gave a 10. You also get my Yellow Dragon Award.<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173263" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173263.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I really like the image, not so much the title. Very good use of the Dutch tilt technique to intensify the feeling. Voted earlier and gave a 10. You also get my Yellow Dragon Award.', '2016-04-17 04:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
